Z||000000||TheFiero64||02-28-2001||11:14 AM||||I found this on the Redline Oil website <A HREF="http://www.redlineoil.com/redlineoil/mtlti.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.redlineoil.com/redlineoil/mtlti.htm</A>  I just ordered some. It seems like the only thing we should be using.<P>You can order it here <A HREF="http://www.racerpartswholesale.com/redline4.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.racerpartswholesale.com/redline4.htm</A> ||||reg||3
Z||000001||Wannabe||02-28-2001||11:34 AM||||Yes, it's good stuff. You will notice an improvement in shifting. Amsoil series 2000 and BG synchroshift are also very good.||||reg||1
